        "text": "In the first four trials, 36 peremptory challenges were used against African American jurors, and in the sixth trial, five of six challenges targeted African American jurors."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6a47be7964533f8095630376d2ab79acec46a09f6b7615dfa0f3a12dad9a29ff",
