            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioner argues that this pattern reflects an unconstitutional intent to minimize African American jurors, implicating the Batson prohibition on race\u2011based peremptory strikes."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "MS. JOHNSON",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6a47be7964533f8095630376d2ab79acec46a09f6b7615dfa0f3a12dad9a29ff",
