            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "MS. JOHNSON noted that in prior cases such as Swain, Arlington Heights, and Miller\u2011El, history was considered relevant to Batson analysis."
      }
